{"type":"item.completed","item":{"id":"item_18","type":"agent_message","text":"The fused kernel is already about 2× faster than bias-fused library calls on short sequences and remains faster at the largest shape. I’m narrowing tile and pipeline choices by matrix-row count now; the main remaining risk is numerical agreement across all 16 cases, which I’ll validate after fixing the dispatch table."}}
